  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with Aussie spice blend and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the fries between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6462e79ed0eff91325050a7e/step-e2a743cd.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice tomato. Slice haloumi to get one piece per person.\n• In a small bowl, combine the soy sauce and sweet chilli sauce. Little cooks: Take charge by combining the sauces!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6462e79ed0eff91325050a7e/step-f5428b70.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice haloumi to get one piece per person.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6462e79ed0eff91325050a7e/step-fda42576.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Add sweet chilli mixture and cook, turning haloumi to coat, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6462e79ed0eff91325050a7e-28254084.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, halve bake-at-home burger buns and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6462e79ed0eff91325050a7e/step-a2feeabe.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread the bun bases with garlic aioli.\n• Top each bun base with some mixed salad leaves, tomato slices and sweet chilli haloumi.\n• Serve with spiced sweet potato fries. Enjoy! Little cooks: Take the lead and help build the burgers!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6462e79ed0eff91325050a7e/step-80b52332.jpg"
    }
  ]
